{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach, take, move and check properties. Otherwise scan area, then move, finally do task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectDestination    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextArea    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
